Description: Pure Python Android APK Engine, Multi-Store Packager & Toolchain
 Ultra-fast zero-dependency Android APK engine, decoder, and multi-store packager
 written in pure Python. Provides zero-copy memoryview parsing for binary
 AndroidManifest.xml and DEX headers, with first-class scaffolding and packaging
 toolchains for Kivy, Pygame, Flet, BeeWare (Toga), Ren'Py, and WebView apps,
 plus store bundles for Google Play (.aab), Apple (.ipa), and Windows Store (.msix).
